note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note erratum E2: in function mode a sized array may be passed to an unsized parameter of an
note internal function: accepted.
om2
fn inner v view ulong * to ulong
x = ulong 0
for i ulong len v
x = add x get v i
end
ret x
end
fn outer a view ulong 4 to ulong
ret inner a
end
